d/cache records&quot;]},&quot;scope&quot;:&quot;Payment, call, notification and ordinary conversation excluded; AI and Reel-sharing retained.&quot;,&quot;note&quot;:&quot;Accept-original includes mobile direct upload. Presigning binds one publishIntentId to a deterministic user-owned key and 24-hour Content upload lease; the signed PUT expires in 300 seconds and returns 412 when already present. Media completion persists validated HLS/thumbnail and queues evidence; attempt fencing, source preservation and opt-in cleanup are sequences 27–31.&quot;,&quot;requestEnvelope&quot;:&quot;Authenticated actor/viewer and operation-specific Reel/conversation/target/session IDs are part of request datasets; public-link requests use token context.&quot;,&quot;layoutBoxes&quot;:{&quot;p1&quot;:[280,390,240,110],&quot;p2&quot;:[630,390,240,110],&quot;p3&quot;:[980,390,240,110],&quot;u&quot;:[25,395,140,100],&quot;uout&quot;:[1340,395,160,100],&quot;reel&quot;:[260,145,280,90],&quot;original&quot;:[260,700,280,90],&quot;source&quot;:[610,700,280,90],&quot;derived&quot;:[610,145,280,90],&quot;catalog&quot;:[960,145,280,90],&quot;output&quot;:[960,700,280,90]},&quot;layoutRoutes&quot;:{&quot;08-dfd-media-f1&quot;:[[165,445.0],[280,445.0]],&quot;08-dfd-media-f2&quot;:[[1220,445.0],[1340,445.0]],&quot;08-dfd-media-f3&quot;:[[520,445.0],[630,445.0]],&quot;08-dfd-media-f4&quot;:[[870,445.0],[980,445.0]],&quot;08-dfd-media-f5&quot;:[[400.0,235],[400.0,390]],&quot;08-dfd-media-f6&quot;:[[400.0,500],[400.0,700]],&quot;08-dfd-media-f7&quot;:[[750.0,700],[750.0,500]],&quot;08-dfd-media-f8&quot;:[[750.0,390],[750.0,235]],&quot;08-dfd-media-f9&quot;:[[1150.0,235],[1150.0,390]],&quot;08-dfd-media-f10&quot;:[[1050.0,390],[1050.0,235]],&quot;08-dfd-media-f11&quot;:[[1100.0,700],[1100.0,500]]},&quot;layoutLabels&quot;:{&quot;08-dfd-media-f3&quot;:[537.15,414.0,75.7,62],&quot;08-dfd-media-f4&quot;:[890.8,414.0,68.4,62],&quot;08-dfd-media-f1&quot;:[177.35,414.0,90.3,62],&quot;08-dfd-media-f2&quot;:[12